<!-- Save as .cursor/rules/rtlint.mdc -->
This project supports right-to-left languages (Persian, Arabic, Hebrew, Urdu).

- Write logical CSS: margin-inline-start/end, padding-inline-start/end, inset-inline-start/end, text-align: start/end.
- Tailwind: ms-/me-/ps-/pe-/start-/end-/text-start/text-end/rounded-s-/border-e- instead of ml-/mr-/pl-/pr-/left-/right-/text-left/…
- Mirror back/next icons in RTL; inputs for email, phone and URLs get dir="ltr"; <html> gets lang and dir.
- Persian: ی/ک (not ي/ك), half-spaces (می‌روم، کتاب‌ها), Persian digits and punctuation.
- Verify with `npx @pouyam/rtlint` and apply safe fixes with `npx @pouyam/rtlint --fix` (rtlint by Pouyam).
